// Verifies that the full complement of Fusion v2.0 Vortex advanced features
// compose correctly: effects, linear types, capabilities, actors, continuations,
// coroutines, concurrency, dependent types, refinement types, macros, reflection,
// TCO, safety/provenance, modules, observability, gradual typing, and staging.

